{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:76e11af94d353c6e","name":"Ram","source":{"id":"source:reference-76e11af94d353c6e","title":"Ram","revision":18431,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:07:15Z","sha256":"05c2bdd919884c7f582a841bb4e301aedc7d0469ad371f04155f0e0b08958a5a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18431","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ram&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-76e11af94d353c6e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," can attempt to Ram a target by moving its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," into the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},". You must have sufficient movement to reach the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},", and the Ram is treated as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},". You can use your Vehicle to Ram just about anything, including another Vehicle, a creature, or a structure.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check at a -10 penalty against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". If the check succeeds, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", the target, and all passengers aboard Vehicles involved in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," (including you) take the amount of damage listed in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collisions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collisions","referenceId":"reference:38a01513f532d9ed"},". Assuming you're alive and conscious, you can continue moving through the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"}," if your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," has any movement left. Otherwise, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," is pushed out of the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},", and into the nearest available square(s), and your turn ends. If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check fails, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", the target, and all passengers aboard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," involved in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," (including you) take half damage. In addition, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," is pushed out of the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},", and into the nearest available square(s), and your turn ends.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Evasion"}]}," Talent, you can reduce or negate the damage your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," and its passengers take when Rammed by another Vehicle.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["All-Out Movement"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If the colliding Vehicle is performing an ",{"tag":"a","children":["All-Out Movement"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/All-Out_Movement","referenceId":"reference:c3e269326f94373b"}," Action, or moving at Maximum Velocity, double the damage caused by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
